.TH unlink 1  "unlink " 
.SH NAME
unlink \- Unlink `thread` from `item`, whatever attributes the link currently carries
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBunlink\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITHREAD\fR> <\fIITEM\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unlink `thread` from `item`, whatever attributes the link currently carries
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITHREAD\fR>

.TP
<\fIITEM\fR>

